  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Libya Protection - NRC Strategic Partnership Agreement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flyktninghjelpen/NRC in Libya: In the West region, NRC provides emergency and basic service assistance to refugee, asylum seeker and migrants addressing gaps in education and protection services in Tripoli and Misrata. For Libyan IDPs, returnees, and host communities, NRC focuses on pathways to durable solutions, especially in Tawergha, where the population faces high vulnerability. In the East, NRC offers essential services like housing rehabilitation and multi-sector interventions for Sudanese in Al-Kufra, responding to displacement and migration challenges, particularly in Benghazi and flood-affected areas. Sectors include Information, counselling and legal assistance (ICLA) and Protection from violence (PfV). The project design is informed by a gender analysis, and all indicators are disaggregated by sex.</narrative>
  </description>
